  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening capacities of Public and Private Sector for regulation, certification and marketing of organic products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed TCP will provide the necessary technical support to finalization and implementation of Organic law and supporting regulations been developed in GCP/KYR/022/ROK project. Technical support to strengthen capacities in organic certification with establishment of local certification agencies and accreditation to EU and other potential export markets. Strengthening capacities to increase the sustainable production of quality competitive organic products and food destined for both the domestic and foreign markets.</narrative>
  </description>
